DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
4895::$$$message_0035_0000_0000$$$::It's after dinner.[lr]::
4896::$$$message_0035_0000_0001$$$::We're relaxing over tea...[lr]::
4897::$$$message_0035_0000_0002$$$::"By the way, [cacheimage storage=凛私服05c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服05c(中)]did anything interesting happen while I was gone?"[lr]::
4898::$$$message_0035_0000_0003$$$::...when suddenly, she asks me that.::
4899::$$$message_0035_0001_0000$$$::"Not really... Didn't Sakura tell you in her letter?"[lr]::
4900::$$$message_0035_0001_0001$$$::"There was only that really long part that you dictated.[lr]::
4901::$$$message_0035_0001_0002$$$::[chgfg storage=凛私服08a(中) time=300]She said everyone's doing fine, but I know she was just being polite."::
4902::$$$message_0035_0002_0000$$$::Sakura must have been trying not to make her sister worry.[lr]::
4903::$$$message_0035_0002_0001$$$::Tohsaka picked up on that.::
4904::$$$message_0035_0003_0000$$$::"She wasn't feeling well at one point, but she didn't mention it in the letter. [cacheimage storage=凛私服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服02a(中) time=300]I've been wondering about that."::
4905::$$$message_0035_0004_0000$$$::"Ahh... I see.[lr]::
4906::$$$message_0035_0004_0001$$$::Sakura did catch a cold, but except for that everyone was fine.[lr]::
4907::$$$message_0035_0004_0002$$$::I've never seen Fuji-nee catch a cold from anyone else."[lr]::
4908::$$$message_0035_0004_0003$$$::She might be built different, as the saying goes[line len=2]nah, it's just that she trains harder than the rest of us.::
4909::$$$message_0035_0005_0000$$$::"I'm not sure Saber and Rider can even get sick.[lr]::
4910::$$$message_0035_0005_0001$$$::Saber's been especially upbeat. You know what they say about weather and animals in the fall."[lr]::
4911::$$$message_0035_0005_0002$$$::"Her appetite's been up, like Sakura?"::
4912::$$$message_0035_0006_0000$$$::"So much that I wonder if she's getting ready to hibernate for the winter."[lr]::
4913::$$$message_0035_0006_0001$$$::I've had my work cut out for me in the kitchen.[lr]::
4914::$$$message_0035_0006_0002$$$::...Well, there are times I worry about how many pots of rice I'm cooking.::
4915::$$$message_0035_0007_0000$$$::"Ahaha... [cacheimage storage=凛私服08e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服08e(中) time=300]Even if Saber is part dragonkin, I don't think she'd actually hibernate come wintertime."[lr]::
4916::$$$message_0035_0007_0001$$$::"...Dragonkin?"[lr]::
4917::$$$message_0035_0007_0002$$$::I frown at the unusual vocabulary.::
4918::$$$message_0035_0008_0000$$$::"Huh... You didn't know?[lr]::
4919::$$$message_0035_0008_0001$$$::They used the factor of a dragon, the apex of the Phantasmals, to create her."[lr]::
4920::$$$message_0035_0008_0002$$$::"No, I know that much.[lr]::
4921::$$$message_0035_0008_0003$$$::Saber's told me that she's like a dragon."[lr]::
4922::$$$message_0035_0008_0004$$$::It's more that I only know that much.::
4923::$$$message_0035_0009_0000$$$::"Hmm... When you think of a dragon, what do you imagine?"[lr]::
4924::$$$message_0035_0009_0001$$$::"Hm..."[lr]::
4925::$$$message_0035_0009_0002$$$::I've been told that dragons are the apex of all the species that exist only in fantasy and illusions.::
4926::$$$message_0035_0010_0000$$$::"...I guess a king of all animals that humans can't measure up to.[lr]::
4927::$$$message_0035_0010_0001$$$::Fire-breathing, with lizard eyes, whiskers and fangs, flying, demanding virgin sacrifices...stuff like that."[lr]::
4928::$$$message_0035_0010_0002$$$::"Hehe. It would be funny to see Saber with all of those."::
4929::$$$message_0035_0011_0000$$$::"...Can't deny that.[lr]::
4930::$$$message_0035_0011_0001$$$::Whenever Fuji-nee steals a snack from her, she looks like she might actually breathe fire."[lr]::
4931::$$$message_0035_0011_0002$$$::"They're still at it, huh?[lr]::
4932::$$$message_0035_0011_0003$$$::Maybe I should analyze what Ms. Fujimura's made of sometime... [cacheimage storage=凛私服06c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服06c(中) time=300]There might even be a fairy inside her..."::
4933::$$$message_0035_0012_0000$$$::I'm not sure I'm brave enough to find out the results.[lr]::
4934::$$$message_0035_0012_0001$$$::But I digress.::
4935::$$$message_0035_0013_0000$$$::"Oh, and how they like to hoard gold and shiny things."[lr]::
4936::$$$message_0035_0013_0001$$$::"A dragon's hoard alone is enough to make it a Phantasmal, yeah...[cacheimage storage=凛私服03d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服03d(中) time=300] Wait, you mean Saber is into hoarding gold?"::
4937::$$$message_0035_0014_0000$$$::"I'm not sure. She does seem to like being economical, so she might have it in her to do that."[lr]::
4938::$$$message_0035_0014_0001$$$::Even if she had such a habit, it probably wouldn't be a problem.::
4939::$$$message_0035_0015_0000$$$::"Also...they live in the sea for a thousand years and the mountains for a thousand years and swim up the Yangtze River to reach the Dragon Gate..."[lr]::
4940::$$$message_0035_0015_0001$$$::"Wait, we're talking about Eastern dragons now?"[lr]::
4941::$$$message_0035_0015_0002$$$::"I guess there's a difference between the Western kings of beasts and Eastern gods of beasts, though.[lr]::
4942::$$$message_0035_0015_0003$$$::What else do people say about dragons..."::
4943::$$$message_0035_0016_0000$$$::"Saber has five talons. She's a king, after all."[lr]::
4944::$$$message_0035_0016_0001$$$::Hey, I was about to say that.[lr]::
4945::$$$message_0035_0016_0002$$$::What else...::
4946::$$$message_0035_0017_0000$$$::"This is another Eastern dragon thing,[lr]::
4947::$$$message_0035_0017_0001$$$::but they supposedly have a reverse scale."[lr]::
4948::$$$message_0035_0017_0002$$$::In some legends, dragons have one scale on their body that grows backwards, and if you touch it, even the most docile of dragons will fly into a godlike fury.::
4949::$$$message_0035_0018_0000$$$::"Oh. That sounds like something Saber might actually have."[lr]::
4950::$$$message_0035_0018_0001$$$::A reply so shockingly simple it's almost disappointing.[lr]::
4951::$$$message_0035_0018_0002$$$::Teacup in hand, I let Tohsaka elaborate.::
4952::$$$message_0035_0019_0000$$$::"Saber's got so many good qualities, she's got to have at least one like that.[lr]::
4953::$$$message_0035_0019_0001$$$::It's not an Achilles' heel, exactly, but she needs something to balance out the good."::
4954::$$$message_0035_0020_0000$$$::"An Achilles' heel is a weakness, though.[lr]::
4955::$$$message_0035_0020_0001$$$::A reverse scale is...more like a flaw, or a shortcoming."::
4956::$$$message_0035_0021_0000$$$::"Those all mean the same thing.[lr]::
4957::$$$message_0035_0021_0001$$$::I'm not talking about balancing Saber's personality, but her place in the natural world.[lr]::
4958::$$$message_0035_0021_0002$$$::The natural cycle would stagnate if there were eternally flawless beings who never waste away. A being that's stronger than everyone else has to have something about them that's inferior to everyone else."::
4959::$$$message_0035_0022_0000$$$::"...I see. For example..."[lr]::
4960::$$$message_0035_0022_0001$$$::There's a certain person I know who can do almost everything, but has a habit of screwing up at the last moment.::
4961::$$$message_0035_0023_0000$$$::"Hey. Why'd you go all quiet?[lr]::
4962::$$$message_0035_0023_0001$$$::You got something you want to say to me?"[lr]::
4963::$$$message_0035_0023_0002$$$::"Not really. I just thought that you understand this really well.[lr]::
4964::$$$message_0035_0023_0003$$$::A reverse scale, though..."::
4965::$$$message_0035_0024_0000$$$::...Does Saber have one?[lr]::
4966::$$$message_0035_0024_0001$$$::If you touch it in front of other people...[lr]::
4967::$$$message_0035_0024_0002$$$::...would something like that happen?::
4968::$$$message_0035_0025_0000$$$::...[lr]::
4969::$$$message_0035_0025_0001$$$::......[lr]::
4970::$$$message_0035_0025_0002$$$::.........Uh oh.[lr]::
4971::$$$message_0035_0025_0003$$$::That sounds like it'd be funny to see.::
4972::$$$message_0035_0026_0000$$$::"What, Emiya? You're staring off into the distance.[lr]::
4973::$$$message_0035_0026_0001$$$::Did you think of something interesting?"::
4974::$$$message_0035_0027_0000$$$::"Huh!? [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=-3]Uh, no, not really!"[lr]::
4975::$$$message_0035_0027_0001$$$::I sip my tea to hide my reaction.[lr]::
4976::$$$message_0035_0027_0002$$$::...That was close.[lr]::
4977::$$$message_0035_0027_0003$$$::Imagine teasing Saber! I must've gotten lured in by Tohsaka's wicked aura!::
4978::$$$message_0035_0028_0000$$$::"I suspect it's on the back of her neck."[lr]::
4979::$$$message_0035_0028_0001$$$::"W-what are you talking about!?"::
4980::$$$message_0035_0029_0000$$$::"Nothing. It's just my opinion, nothing you need to worry about.[lr]::
4981::$$$message_0035_0029_0001$$$::I'll back you up and hold her down from behind."[lr]::
4982::$$$message_0035_0029_0002$$$::"Seriously, what are you talking about!?"[lr]::
4983::$$$message_0035_0029_0003$$$::Tohsaka shrugs and stands up.::
4984::$$$message_0035_0030_0000$$$::"Okay, I should get going.[lr]::
4985::$$$message_0035_0030_0001$$$::It's none of my business, but I understand how you feel, Emiya.[lr]::
4986::$$$message_0035_0030_0002$$$::A Master needs to manage his Servant properly.[lr]::
4987::$$$message_0035_0030_0003$$$::And you should find out everything you need to know, especially if it's something that could lead to disaster."::
4988::$$$message_0035_0031_0000$$$::"See ya," she calls as she leaves down the hall.[lr]::
4989::$$$message_0035_0031_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
4990::$$$message_0035_0031_0002$$$::A Master's responsibility, huh?[lr]::
4991::$$$message_0035_0031_0003$$$::I'm just a tiny bit curious about the reverse scale, maybe I should check...::
4992::$$$message_0035_0032_0000$$$::"Are you going back to your room, Shirou?"[lr]::
4993::$$$message_0035_0032_0001$$$::"Whoa, [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-4]Saber!?"[lr]::
4994::$$$message_0035_0032_0002$$$::That's some incredible timing.[lr]::
4995::$$$message_0035_0032_0003$$$::I bump into the person of the hour.::
4996::$$$message_0035_0033_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
4997::$$$message_0035_0033_0001$$$::The reverse scale.[lr]::
4998::$$$message_0035_0033_0002$$$::Is there a spot on her that would cause disaster if I touched it...?::
4999::$$$message_0035_0034_0000$$$::"What is the matter? You look a little pale."[lr]::
5000::$$$message_0035_0034_0001$$$::"...Sorry. I was just thinking."::
5001::$$$message_0035_0035_0000$$$::...Oh, no.[lr]::
5002::$$$message_0035_0035_0001$$$::I can't stop thinking about it.[lr]::
5003::$$$message_0035_0035_0002$$$::Now I can't rest until I find out whether Saber has a reverse scale, or even what it is.::
5004::$$$message_0035_0036_0000$$$::"...Um.[lr]::
5005::$$$message_0035_0036_0001$$$::Do you have a moment?"[lr]::
5006::$$$message_0035_0036_0002$$$::"Yes?"[lr]::
5007::$$$message_0035_0036_0003$$$::"Your collar is crooked."[lr]::
5008::$$$message_0035_0036_0004$$$::I reach for Saber's neck.[lr]::
5009::$$$message_0035_0036_0005$$$::My fingers lightly graze her pale, silky skin.::
5010::$$$message_0035_0037_0000$$$::"...[quake vmax=10 hmax=0 time=500]Shirou!?"[lr]::
5011::$$$message_0035_0037_0001$$$::"Stay still. It's out of place."[lr]::
5012::$$$message_0035_0037_0002$$$::I feel her neck as I say it.[lr]::
5013::$$$message_0035_0037_0003$$$::Nothing feels different... I heard the reverse scale might be under the jaw, so maybe it's here?::
5014::$$$message_0035_0038_0000$$$::"I suspect it's on the back of her neck."[lr]::
5015::$$$message_0035_0038_0001$$$::Suspect...[lr]::
5016::$$$message_0035_0038_0002$$$::I...suspect...[lr]::
5017::$$$message_0035_0038_0003$$$::Her advice echoes in my head.::
5018::$$$message_0035_0039_0000$$$::"Ah... Shirou...[wvl][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=-3]mm... M-my collar..."[lr]::
5019::$$$message_0035_0039_0001$$$::"Hold on. I think your ribbon's crooked, too."[lr]::
5020::$$$message_0035_0039_0002$$$::I touch the nape of her neck, using her not-at-all crooked ribbon as an excuse.::
5021::$$$message_0035_0040_0000$$$::"Ah... Ha, ah..."[lr]::
5022::$$$message_0035_0040_0001$$$::When I touch the nape of her neck, where I see a few hairs out of place, I feel an unexplainable excitement.[lr]::
5023::$$$message_0035_0040_0002$$$::I'm just looking for Saber's reverse scale. No inappropriate thoughts at all...right...[lr]::
5024::$$$message_0035_0040_0003$$$::I can't do it, Master! My sanity's going to give out before I find anything that even resembles a scale...!::
5025::$$$message_0035_0041_0000$$$::"Ho ho ho.[lr]::
5026::$$$message_0035_0041_0001$$$::Then search her back! If flooding the castle won't work, then burn it all down!"[lr]::
5027::$$$message_0035_0041_0002$$$::H-her advice saw that far ahead!?[lr]::
5028::$$$message_0035_0041_0003$$$::Xie xie! A thousand thanks, o wise Master Zhuge Rin!::
5029::$$$message_0035_0042_0000$$$::"Shirou, no, not here..."[lr]::
5030::$$$message_0035_0042_0001$$$::Maybe I'm too close now. Her cowlick tickles my cheek.[lr]::
5031::$$$message_0035_0042_0002$$$::"Argh, this little..."[lr]::
5032::$$$message_0035_0042_0003$$$::It's in the way![lr]::
5033::$$$message_0035_0042_0004$$$::Let me touch her back...!::
5034::$$$message_0035_0043_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
5035::$$$message_0035_0043_0001$$$::For some reason, I've fallen over and I'm on my back.::
5036::$$$message_0035_0044_0000$$$::"Oh no, are you all right, Shirou!?"[lr]::
5037::$$$message_0035_0044_0001$$$::"Uh... Ow."[lr]::
5038::$$$message_0035_0044_0002$$$::I check my body without saying anything.[lr]::
5039::$$$message_0035_0044_0003$$$::I broke my fall effectively, so I'm not hurt.::
5040::$$$message_0035_0045_0000$$$::"I'm so sorry, I moved on reflex..."[lr]::
5041::$$$message_0035_0045_0001$$$::"You threw me?"[lr]::
5042::$$$message_0035_0045_0002$$$::"...Yes. I grabbed your arm and hurled you with brute force, like Lancer would..."::
5043::$$$message_0035_0046_0000$$$::I can believe it.[lr]::
5044::$$$message_0035_0046_0001$$$::I'm more than six meters away from where we were standing in the hallway.::
5045::$$$message_0035_0047_0000$$$::"I should have warned you about that.[lr]::
5046::$$$message_0035_0047_0001$$$::What if I injured you by accident[line len=2]"[lr]::
5047::$$$message_0035_0047_0002$$$::"I'm not injured, um..."::
5048::$$$message_0035_0048_0000$$$::Saber didn't throw me out of embarrassment when I touched her body.[lr]::
5049::$$$message_0035_0048_0001$$$::The instant my fingers touched her cowlick, she threw me as if on reflex.::
5050::$$$message_0035_0049_0000$$$::"Can you stand? Here, give me your hand..."[lr]::
5051::$$$message_0035_0049_0001$$$::"I'm fine.[lr]::
5052::$$$message_0035_0049_0002$$$::What should you have[line len=2]owww[line len=2]warned me about?"::
5053::$$$message_0035_0050_0000$$$::"My, er, cowlick."[lr]::
5054::$$$message_0035_0050_0001$$$::"You don't want me to touch it?"[lr]::
5055::$$$message_0035_0050_0002$$$::She nods.[lr]::
5056::$$$message_0035_0050_0003$$$::...I've been wondering about it for a while. Apparently, it bothers her, too.::
5057::$$$message_0035_0051_0000$$$::"It's a long story..."[lr]::
5058::$$$message_0035_0051_0001$$$::"All right. Let's go back to the veranda.[lr]::
5059::$$$message_0035_0051_0002$$$::Argh, falling on the floor like that hurts..."::
5060::$$$message_0035_0052_0000$$$::"It happened before I united the kingdom."::
5061::$$$message_0035_0053_0000$$$::"A number of lords started wars in opposition to my coronation.[lr]::
5062::$$$message_0035_0053_0001$$$::After I received the advice of my old mentor, and the blessing of the Lady of the Lake, I took to the battlefield with my gallant, loyal knights for the sake of the kingdom and its people."::
5063::$$$message_0035_0054_0000$$$::"Eleven kings had allied against me...but they had all bent the knee to a foreign kingdom.[lr]::
5064::$$$message_0035_0054_0001$$$::Its ruler's name was Rience. He and his younger brother Nero intended to conquer the north."::
5065::$$$message_0035_0055_0000$$$::...Ah.[lr]::
5066::$$$message_0035_0055_0001$$$::I know this story.[lr]::
5067::$$$message_0035_0055_0002$$$::It's the famous tale of King Rience's Robe, right?::
5068::$$$message_0035_0056_0000$$$::"King Rience's messenger brought an insolent message to my court,::
5069::$$$message_0035_0057_0000$$$::'The great King Rience decorates his cloak with the beards of eleven kings who have sworn their loyalty to him.[lr]::
5070::$$$message_0035_0057_0001$$$::He needs the beard of just one more king to complete his collection. He demands that King Arthur surrender his beard and pledge loyalty, lest we crush your kingdom underfoot.'"[lr]::
5071::$$$message_0035_0057_0002$$$::...Yeah, that's the one.[lr]::
5072::$$$message_0035_0057_0003$$$::I'm not sure how that would have worked out, though.[lr]::
5073::$$$message_0035_0057_0004$$$::After all, Saber doesn't have a beard.::
5074::$$$message_0035_0058_0000$$$::"I told the messenger,[lr]::
5075::$$$message_0035_0058_0001$$$::'Unfortunately, I have no beard, nor are there any knees here who would bend for King Rience.[lr]::
5076::$$$message_0035_0058_0002$$$::In fact, before long, King Rience will either bend his knee to me, or I will have his beard along with his head.'"::
5077::$$$message_0035_0059_0000$$$::Yup, sounds like Saber, all right.[lr]::
5078::$$$message_0035_0059_0001$$$::I can only imagine Rience went back to his country after[line len=2][lr]::
5079::$$$message_0035_0059_0002$$$::"King Rience flew into a fury when he heard my response.[lr]::
5080::$$$message_0035_0059_0003$$$::And when his messenger told him what I looked like, he said,::
5081::$$$message_0035_0060_0000$$$::'That arrogant Arthur.[lr]::
5082::$$$message_0035_0060_0001$$$::Then I'll cut off that cowlick on your head and add it to my collection!'"[lr]::
5083::$$$message_0035_0060_0002$$$::"Pfft!"[lr]::
5084::$$$message_0035_0060_0003$$$::Wait, that's not even a beard!::
5085::$$$message_0035_0061_0000$$$::"Whoa whoa, hold on![lr]::
5086::$$$message_0035_0061_0001$$$::Are we talking about the same cowlick!?"::
5087::$$$message_0035_0062_0000$$$::"Of course. What else do you think he wanted?[lr]::
5088::$$$message_0035_0062_0001$$$::Shirou, please don't interrupt the story with silly questions. The good part starts here."[lr]::
5089::$$$message_0035_0062_0002$$$::"Y-yeah. Sorry, that wasn't very sensible of me."::
5090::$$$message_0035_0063_0000$$$::"As long as you understand.[lr]::
5091::$$$message_0035_0063_0001$$$::The wars that followed were all about whether I could protect my cowlick or not.[lr]::
5092::$$$message_0035_0063_0002$$$::Since then, my enemies always mocked my cowlick, threatening to cut it off, tie it in a knot, decorate their ribbons with it, or even plant flowers on it.[lr]::
5093::$$$message_0035_0063_0003$$$::Therefore, the integrity of my cowlick was a matter of national pride."::
5094::$$$message_0035_0064_0000$$$::"The fighting was fierce, but my dignity prevailed in the end.[lr]::
5095::$$$message_0035_0064_0001$$$::Hence, my cowlick became a symbol of the kingdom's pride. It was as valuable as my own head. Yes, even the queen was not permitted to touch it."::
5096::$$$message_0035_0065_0000$$$::"Do you understand, Shirou?[lr]::
5097::$$$message_0035_0065_0001$$$::That is why I must ask that you not touch my cowlick."::
5098::$$$message_0035_0066_0000$$$::Saber huffs proudly.[lr]::
5099::$$$message_0035_0066_0001$$$::That's, um...[lr]::
5100::$$$message_0035_0066_0002$$$::Are we sure I'm not still unconscious after she threw me earlier?::
5101::$$$message_0035_0067_0000$$$::"...What's wrong, Shirou?"[lr]::
5102::$$$message_0035_0067_0001$$$::"...I have a question.[lr]::
5103::$$$message_0035_0067_0002$$$::You said that you won the war.[lr]::
5104::$$$message_0035_0067_0003$$$::Did you shave King Rience's beard as payback?"::
5105::$$$message_0035_0068_0000$$$::"We took him prisoner and I wanted to cut his head off, but my mentor stopped me.[lr]::
5106::$$$message_0035_0068_0001$$$::He said that an eye for an eye and a beard for a beard would only lead to a cycle of revenge.[lr]::
5107::$$$message_0035_0068_0002$$$::So, I followed his advice..."::
5108::$$$message_0035_0069_0000$$$::"What advice?"[lr]::
5109::$$$message_0035_0069_0001$$$::"We used a magical hair growth drug to connect King Rience's sideburns and moustache to his brother's eyebrows, and left it at that.[lr]::
5110::$$$message_0035_0069_0002$$$::Every time he looked in the mirror, it would remind him that one should put his money where his mouth is, so to speak."::
5111::$$$message_0035_0070_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
5112::$$$message_0035_0070_0001$$$::A bloodless victory sounds great, but that's a very immature way to settle it.[lr]::
5113::$$$message_0035_0070_0002$$$::Poor King Rience and his brother Nero were probably laughingstocks for the rest of their lives.::
5114::$$$message_0035_0071_0000$$$::"Your cowlick had that much history behind it, huh..."[lr]::
5115::$$$message_0035_0071_0001$$$::"Yes. That's why it's an old habit to immediately protect it... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服05a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=セイバー私服05a(中) time=300]I'm terribly sorry."::
5116::$$$message_0035_0072_0000$$$::"Ah, it's fine. It was my fault, anyway."[lr]::
5117::$$$message_0035_0072_0001$$$::I was the one who was careless for touching such a mysterious thing in the first place.::
5118::$$$message_0035_0073_0000$$$::"I appreciate your understanding.[lr]::
5119::$$$message_0035_0073_0001$$$::It should also be said that a woman's hair is a symbol of magical power.[lr]::
5120::$$$message_0035_0073_0002$$$::If taken against her will, it can be used to host a curse.[lr]::
5121::$$$message_0035_0073_0003$$$::A cursed king could lead to the kingdom's ruin, so you could say that my cowlick is doubly a weakness."::
5122::$$$message_0035_0074_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
5123::$$$message_0035_0074_0001$$$::Yeah, that sounds pretty serious.[lr]::
5124::$$$message_0035_0074_0002$$$::...Hang on, though.[lr]::
5125::$$$message_0035_0074_0003$$$::If it's Saber's weakness, does that mean...[lr]::
5126::$$$message_0035_0074_0004$$$::"...Shirou?"[lr]::
5127::$$$message_0035_0074_0005$$$::I look up at her.[lr]::
5128::$$$message_0035_0074_0006$$$::...Huh.[lr]::
5129::$$$message_0035_0074_0007$$$::She's making a very stern expression...::
5130::$$$message_0035_0075_0000$$$::"You fixed my collar for me...but why did you touch the back of my neck?"[lr]::
5131::$$$message_0035_0075_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
5132::$$$message_0035_0075_0002$$$::Hehehe.[lr]::
5133::$$$message_0035_0075_0003$$$::I knew that excuse was too much of a stretch.::
5134::$$$message_0035_0076_0000$$$::"And then even the nape of my neck... Shirou, can you explain why you did that?"[lr]::
5135::$$$message_0035_0076_0001$$$::"N-no real reason, Saber. I just misjudged the spot."[lr]::
5136::$$$message_0035_0076_0002$$$::It's not my vision that has a problem, but my morals, though.::
5137::$$$message_0035_0077_0000$$$::"Oh? So you often go around touching women's necks in such a cavalier manner?"[lr]::
5138::$$$message_0035_0077_0001$$$::"I didn't mean anything by it, really.[lr]::
5139::$$$message_0035_0077_0002$$$::Look, you just sit and relax. I'll be back with some tea and snacks."::
5140::$$$message_0035_0078_0000$$$::"Wait.[lr]::
5141::$$$message_0035_0078_0001$$$::Shirou, I want you to answer me again while looking me in the eyes."[lr]::
5142::$$$message_0035_0078_0002$$$::I'm getting an impending sense of doom![lr]::
5143::$$$message_0035_0078_0003$$$::E-e-even the promise of snacks isn't throwing Saber off my scent!::
5144::$$$message_0035_0079_0000$$$::"Shirou. Your refusal to look me in the eye only casts further doubt on you.[lr]::
5145::$$$message_0035_0079_0001$$$::Now, tell me what you were trying to do."::
5146::$$$message_0035_0080_0000$$$::Her intimidating, lethal aura feels suffocating.[lr]::
5147::$$$message_0035_0080_0001$$$::...Urgh, I've got nowhere to run.[lr]::
5148::$$$message_0035_0080_0002$$$::I'm screwed, Master Zhuge Rin.[lr]::
5149::$$$message_0035_0080_0003$$$::I don't think I can escape even if I run, so I'll just have to confess everything.::
5150::$$$message_0035_0081_0000$$$::"...I was, um, looking for your reverse scale."[lr]::
5151::$$$message_0035_0081_0001$$$::"My what?"[lr]::
5152::$$$message_0035_0081_0002$$$::"Well, you're dragonkin, so I was wondering if there was a scale growing backwards somewhere on your body..."[lr]::
5153::$$$message_0035_0081_0003$$$::I glance at her.[lr]::
5154::$$$message_0035_0081_0004$$$::...Oof. Her eyes are ice cold.::
5155::$$$message_0035_0082_0000$$$::"I see. A scale, you say."[lr]::
5156::$$$message_0035_0082_0001$$$::...Oof. Her voice is ice cold.::
5157::$$$message_0035_0083_0000$$$::"Y-yeah.[lr]::
5158::$$$message_0035_0083_0001$$$::There's a legend that says dragons get really angry if you touch it."[lr]::
5159::$$$message_0035_0083_0002$$$::I start to look away awkwardly...but I can't.[lr]::
5160::$$$message_0035_0083_0003$$$::The air around Saber feels so tense it's practically crackling with electricity.[lr]::
5161::$$$message_0035_0083_0004$$$::...Here it comes.::
5162::$$$message_0035_0084_0000$$$::"SHIROU!!!"[lr]::
5163::$$$message_0035_0084_0001$$$::"Y-yeeees!?"[rf][lr]::
5164::$$$message_0035_0084_0002$$$::"What exactly do you think I am!?"::
5165::$$$message_0035_0085_0000$$$::"You laid hands on me, a knight and a swordsman, to try and find [font italic=true]scales[font italic=false] on my body!? The nerve![lr]::
5166::$$$message_0035_0085_0001$$$::In my day, if you had insulted me like that, I would have demanded an honor duel on the spot!"[lr]::
5167::$$$message_0035_0085_0002$$$::I'm trembling.[lr]::
5168::$$$message_0035_0085_0003$$$::She's mad. Madder than I've ever seen her!::
5169::$$$message_0035_0086_0000$$$::"And you've completely misunderstood what I said about dragonkin![lr]::
5170::$$$message_0035_0086_0001$$$::I've inherited the traits of a dragon, but how ignorant do you have to be to think we're one and the same!?[lr]::
5171::$$$message_0035_0086_0002$$$::How can my Master be this uncomprehending of the world around him!?"::
5172::$$$message_0035_0087_0000$$$::The storm batters me.[lr]::
5173::$$$message_0035_0087_0001$$$::I start to feel despair overtaking me. Ahh, she's going to scold me to death.[lr]::
5174::$$$message_0035_0087_0002$$$::"Ha ha ha. It's too early to give up while you still have a chance to survive, Lord Emiya."[lr]::
5175::$$$message_0035_0087_0003$$$::...No way.[lr]::
5176::$$$message_0035_0087_0004$$$::I'm still hallucinating now, of all times.::
5177::$$$message_0035_0088_0000$$$::"And why would you set your eyes on a comical trait that I'm conscious of! You should know better![lr]::
5178::$$$message_0035_0088_0001$$$::It sounds like something that would make someone transform if touched. Are you implying I have some hidden dark side!?[lr]::
5179::$$$message_0035_0088_0002$$$::You know better than anyone that I have no hidden side!"::
5180::$$$message_0035_0089_0000$$$::Saber's overheating.[lr]::
5181::$$$message_0035_0089_0001$$$::At this rate, I might be kneeling for ten hours straight, followed by three days and three nights of preparing Manchu and Han feasts.[lr]::
5182::$$$message_0035_0089_0002$$$::And you're telling me there's a way to survive this, Master!?::
5183::$$$message_0035_0090_0000$$$::"Indeed. When the enemy rushes in recklessly, that is when their back is least defended.[lr]::
5184::$$$message_0035_0090_0001$$$::As Sun Tzu once said, all warfare is based on deception.[lr]::
5185::$$$message_0035_0090_0002$$$::Basically, if you wanna win, then you gotta tough this out."::
5186::$$$message_0035_0091_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
5187::$$$message_0035_0091_0001$$$::W-wait, that was my master...[lr]::
5188::$$$message_0035_0091_0002$$$::I mean, the root of this entire disaster!::
5189::$$$message_0035_0092_0000$$$::"Are you listening to me, Shirou!?"[lr]::
5190::$$$message_0035_0092_0001$$$::"Y-yes!"[lr]::
5191::$$$message_0035_0092_0002$$$::"Then I demand that you correct your misconception that there are scales on my body, and accept that I do not have a dark side![lr]::
5192::$$$message_0035_0092_0003$$$::And promise to never again entertain such delu[line len=2][cacheimage storage=セイバー私服09b頬(近)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服09b頬(近) textoff=0][se storage=se040.wav][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(279,63,255)(296,20,255)(310,50,255)(329,22,255) storage=凛私服04c(近) accel=-2]Wha!?"::
5193::$$$message_0035_0093_0000$$$::"You're wide open![lr]::
5194::$$$message_0035_0093_0001$$$::You were too focused on Emiya, Saber! Ohoho, you left your back hilariously open!"[lr]::
5195::$$$message_0035_0093_0002$$$::"R-Rin!?[lr]::
5196::$$$message_0035_0093_0003$$$::What are you doing!? This is no time for games[line len=2]"::
5197::$$$message_0035_0094_0000$$$::"Oh no you don't.[lr]::
5198::$$$message_0035_0094_0001$$$::Emiya, this is our last chance![lr]::
5199::$$$message_0035_0094_0002$$$::Now, where is Saber's reverse scale!?"::
5200::$$$message_0035_0095_0000$$$::"!"[lr]::
5201::$$$message_0035_0095_0001$$$::Right, the reverse scale is a weak point, just like how if you grab a monkey's tail, it goes limp![lr]::
5202::$$$message_0035_0095_0002$$$::"Obviously, it's...!"[lr]::
5203::$$$message_0035_0095_0003$$$::I exploit the opening and reach out with my hand.::
5204::$$$message_0035_0096_0000$$$::"Rgh! No, you mustn't, Shirou!"[lr]::
5205::$$$message_0035_0096_0001$$$::"Dooo iiit![lr]::
5206::$$$message_0035_0096_0002$$$::I wanna see you grab her weak spot!"[lr]::
5207::$$$message_0035_0096_0003$$$::Urged on by her irresponsible cheering, my left hand seizes victory.[lr]::
5208::$$$message_0035_0096_0004$$$::"Nngh...!"[lr]::
5209::$$$message_0035_0096_0005$$$::I take hold of her golden cowlick.[lr]::
5210::$$$message_0035_0096_0006$$$::Suddenly...[lr]::
5211::$$$message_0035_0096_0007$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
5212::$$$message_0035_0096_0008$$$::A terrible chill fills the air, like the entire house just became a refrigerator.::
5213::$$$message_0035_0097_0000$$$::Oh man, this isn't just a chill. Isn't that the sound of Excalibur being released!?!?[lr]::
5214::$$$message_0035_0097_0001$$$::"Aaaaaaaaaaargh, Saber!?"[lr]::
5215::$$$message_0035_0097_0002$$$::"Aaaaaaaaaaaah, Saber!?"[lr]::
5216::$$$message_0035_0097_0003$$$::The rabble scatters.[lr]::
5217::$$$message_0035_0097_0004$$$::God has arrived to deliver divine retribution.::
5218::$$$message_0035_0098_0000$$$::"Argh... Owwww..."[lr]::
5219::$$$message_0035_0098_0001$$$::I slowly get up.[lr]::
5220::$$$message_0035_0098_0002$$$::Tohsaka's mischief sent me flying again.::
5221::$$$message_0035_0099_0000$$$::"Ouch, my back... [cacheimage storage=凛fd特殊03a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛fd特殊03a(中) last=凛私服16e(中)]Why is this happening to me?"[lr]::
5222::$$$message_0035_0099_0001$$$::"You've got some nerve to say that.[lr]::
5223::$$$message_0035_0099_0002$$$::This is all your fault, Tohsaka!"[lr]::
5224::$$$message_0035_0099_0003$$$::And I got scammed into being her accomplice.::
5225::$$$message_0035_0100_0000$$$::"W-what? We accomplished what we set out to do, so it's fine, right?[lr]::
5226::$$$message_0035_0100_0001$$$::Now we know that Saber's reverse scale is clearly her cowlick."::
5227::$$$message_0035_0101_0000$$$::"...Hm."[lr]::
5228::$$$message_0035_0101_0001$$$::She's right.[lr]::
5229::$$$message_0035_0101_0002$$$::Saber insisted that she has no reverse scale and wouldn't fly into a rage, but the result was clear.::
5230::$$$message_0035_0102_0000$$$::"...I wouldn't call it a weakness, though.[lr]::
5231::$$$message_0035_0102_0001$$$::She sees it as a flaw, but it might be her worst strong point to the rest of us."[lr]::
5232::$$$message_0035_0102_0002$$$::It was enough to make Saber indiscriminately blow us away.::
5233::$$$message_0035_0103_0000$$$::"And what's wrong with that?[lr]::
5234::$$$message_0035_0103_0001$$$::One of Saber's greatest strengths is her self-control. If she lost her temper at every little thing, she'd be easy to take advantage of."[lr]::
5235::$$$message_0035_0103_0002$$$::She's talking like she wants to get into a bullfight with Saber.::
5236::$$$message_0035_0104_0000$$$::"Oh, so that's why you wear red, Tohsaka."[lr]::
5237::$$$message_0035_0104_0001$$$::"Huh? Is it good that I'm wearing red?"[lr]::
5238::$$$message_0035_0104_0002$$$::"Good for me, but bad for you.[lr]::
5239::$$$message_0035_0104_0003$$$::Saber really is well-behaved, considering she could fly off the handle at any moment."::
5240::$$$message_0035_0105_0000$$$::"You're right.[lr]::
5241::$$$message_0035_0105_0001$$$::I thought she was going to lecture you all day.[lr]::
5242::$$$message_0035_0105_0002$$$::...You only touched it, though. I wonder if her reverse scale only works momentarily."::
5243::$$$message_0035_0106_0000$$$::Thank goodness for that.[lr]::
5244::$$$message_0035_0106_0001$$$::I know now that Saber has a reverse scale, but it would be unbearable if she lost her temper for an entire day after touching it just once.[lr]::
5245::$$$message_0035_0106_0002$$$::She'd change her class to Berserker.::
5246::$$$message_0035_0107_0000$$$::"Yeah.[lr]::
5247::$$$message_0035_0107_0001$$$::If Saber stayed angry all the time..."[lr]::
5248::$$$message_0035_0107_0002$$$::I can't even imagine it, and I'd feel bad for her subjects.::
5249::$$$message_0035_0108_0000$$$::"Let's go back now that we know. Saber's still mad, so we should apologize.[lr]::
5250::$$$message_0035_0108_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Both[font italic=false] of us."[lr]::
5251::$$$message_0035_0108_0002$$$::"Yeah, yeah. I hear you."::
5252::$$$message_0035_0109_0000$$$::She might have recovered from the shock of having her cowlick touched, but she's probably still in a bad mood.[lr]::
5253::$$$message_0035_0109_0001$$$::I need to apologize and tell her that I'll never touch her cowlick for fun again.::
5254::$$$message_0035_0110_0000$$$::"Hey, Saber."[lr]::
5255::$$$message_0035_0110_0001$$$::I call out to her.[lr]::
5256::$$$message_0035_0110_0002$$$::She looks calm.[lr]::
5257::$$$message_0035_0110_0003$$$::"What, Shirou?"[lr]::
5258::$$$message_0035_0110_0004$$$::Her dark side's on full blast!::
5259::$$$message_0035_0111_0000$$$::The veranda seems to warp[lr]::
5260::$$$message_0035_0111_0001$$$::with barely suppressed bloodlust.[lr]::
5261::$$$message_0035_0111_0002$$$::Our Saber is in full killer mode now, glaring at us like two foolish prey animals who just wandered back into the tiger's den.::
5262::$$$message_0035_0112_0000$$$::"Hawa, hawawa, hawawawa, Saber!?"[lr]::
5263::$$$message_0035_0112_0001$$$::"Awa, awawa, awawawa, Saber!?"[lr]::
5264::$$$message_0035_0112_0002$$$::We tremble in unison.[lr]::
5265::$$$message_0035_0112_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
5266::$$$message_0035_0112_0004$$$::Saber doesn't budge.[lr]::
5267::$$$message_0035_0112_0005$$$::Her normally pristine face looks absolutely terrifying right now.::
5268::$$$message_0035_0113_0000$$$::"T-Tohsaka, go on! Go! I don't know what to do!"[lr]::
5269::$$$message_0035_0113_0001$$$::"W-what, you're such a coward, Emiya! You said we would apologize together!"[lr]::
5270::$$$message_0035_0113_0002$$$::The prey squabble among themselves.[lr]::
5271::$$$message_0035_0113_0003$$$::Finally, Saber seems to lose patience with Tohsaka and I deploying our shields at each other.::
5272::$$$message_0035_0114_0000$$$::"Shirou, Rin."[lr]::
5273::$$$message_0035_0114_0001$$$::Dark Saber takes a step in our direction.[lr]::
5274::$$$message_0035_0114_0002$$$::"Yeeeeek! Sh-she's gonna eat us! I'm s-sorry, Saber! We took that too far!"[lr]::
5275::$$$message_0035_0114_0003$$$::I keep my shield up, while Tohsaka flees from Saber's gaze.::
5276::$$$message_0035_0115_0000$$$::"You're being noisy, Rin.[lr]::
5277::$$$message_0035_0115_0001$$$::Did something happen to cause such a commotion?"[lr]::
5278::$$$message_0035_0115_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
5279::$$$message_0035_0115_0003$$$::Saber's voice is dispassionate.[lr]::
5280::$$$message_0035_0115_0004$$$::We timidly make eye contact with her.::
5281::$$$message_0035_0116_0000$$$::"What... Saber, what happened earlier..."[lr]::
5282::$$$message_0035_0116_0001$$$::"I have no memory of it. Don't ask me, Shirou."[lr]::
5283::$$$message_0035_0116_0002$$$::She answers flatly.[lr]::
5284::$$$message_0035_0116_0003$$$::It's hard to tell, but she doesn't seem too upset...I think.::
5285::$$$message_0035_0117_0000$$$::"S-Saber? Just asking, but are you feeling strange at all? You seem a little more violent than usual, and your color is, well..."[lr]::
5286::$$$message_0035_0117_0001$$$::"You think I'm strange?"[lr]::
5287::$$$message_0035_0117_0002$$$::"N-no, not at all! You're not strange all, just the Saber we all know and love![lr]::
5288::$$$message_0035_0117_0003$$$::Isn't that right, Emiya!?"::
5289::$$$message_0035_0118_0000$$$::I desperately nod in agreement.[lr]::
5290::$$$message_0035_0118_0001$$$::"Good. Let us eat. And I want to change my clothes.[lr]::
5291::$$$message_0035_0118_0002$$$::Rin, prepare a change of clothes."[lr]::
5292::$$$message_0035_0118_0003$$$::"Y-yes![lr]::
5293::$$$message_0035_0118_0004$$$::W-will you be wearing my clothing!?"[lr]::
5294::$$$message_0035_0118_0005$$$::"I like your clothes, but I want a change of pace today."::
5295::$$$message_0035_0119_0000$$$::Tohsaka walks Saber off to the guesthouse.[lr]::
5296::$$$message_0035_0119_0001$$$::"Emiya, Emiya. I'll buy you some time, so get lunch ready! Put your back into it, okay!?"[lr]::
5297::$$$message_0035_0119_0002$$$::"...Challenge accepted. Our lives are on the line."[lr]::
5298::$$$message_0035_0119_0003$$$::"Rin."[lr]::
5299::$$$message_0035_0119_0004$$$::"Yes, I'll be right with you!"[lr]::
5300::$$$message_0035_0119_0005$$$::Tohsaka guides Saber away tearfully.::
5301::$$$message_0035_0120_0000$$$::"...I'm counting on you, Tohsaka."[lr]::
5302::$$$message_0035_0120_0001$$$::I can't make a meal that would satisfy Saber now, no matter how much time I have.[lr]::
5303::$$$message_0035_0120_0002$$$::But Tohsaka won't last more than half an hour.::
5304::$$$message_0035_0121_0000$$$::I've heard that in Japanese mythology, sake was used to subdue the eight-headed Yamata-no-Orochi snake.[lr]::
5305::$$$message_0035_0121_0001$$$::That's right, since ancient times, meat, wine, and gold have always been used to appease the mighty.[lr]::
5306::$$$message_0035_0121_0002$$$::"Heh. Hehehe. Heh!"[lr]::
5307::$$$message_0035_0121_0003$$$::I feel all fired up now.[lr]::
5308::$$$message_0035_0121_0004$$$::Will my cooking appease the dragon's rage?[lr]::
5309::$$$message_0035_0121_0005$$$::My ten years of training are finally being put to the test...!::
5310::$$$message_0035_0122_0000$$$::"Inedible. [cacheimage storage=シネスコw1000a,シネスコw1000b,黒セイバー私服01c(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=-130 top=-425 time=200 accel=0 storage=シネスコw1000a][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=-118 top=525 time=200 accel=0 storage=シネスコw1000b][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=277 top=83 time=200 accel=0 storage=黒セイバー私服01c(近)][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=445 top=83 time=8000 accel=0 storage=黒セイバー私服01c(近)][wvl]How far your skills have fallen in just half a day, Shirou."[lr]::
5311::$$$message_0035_0122_0001$$$::"Guagh!?"[lr]::
5312::$$$message_0035_0122_0002$$$::She's a very tough critic.[lr]::
5313::$$$message_0035_0122_0003$$$::I can't believe Saber[line len=2]the very same Saber who always eats my food with a smile[line len=2]just denied my decade of cooking experience after a single bite!::
5314::$$$message_0035_0123_0000$$$::"Emiya, you're sobbing. I know how you feel, but right now we need action, not tears."[lr]::
5315::$$$message_0035_0123_0001$$$::"Shut up! You can't possibly understand how I feel! How wonderful my cooking life with Saber was...! I don't want your cheap pity!"[lr]::
5316::$$$message_0035_0123_0002$$$::"...Ahh, true, I wouldn't know.[lr]::
5317::$$$message_0035_0123_0003$$$::Okay, okay. Go ahead and cry."::
5318::$$$message_0035_0124_0000$$$::"Rin. Cook me that thing you sometimes do.[lr]::
5319::$$$message_0035_0124_0001$$$::Set a good example for Shirou.[lr]::
5320::$$$message_0035_0124_0002$$$::A royal decree comes in from the living room.[lr]::
5321::$$$message_0035_0124_0003$$$::"What thing...you mean that?"[lr]::
5322::$$$message_0035_0124_0004$$$::"What else? With extra mustard."::
5323::$$$message_0035_0125_0000$$$::"What's she talking about, Tohsaka? Can you make something she likes more than the one-pot seafood rice?"[lr]::
5324::$$$message_0035_0125_0001$$$::"...It isn't what she usually likes.[lr]::
5325::$$$message_0035_0125_0002$$$::But I'll teach you the recipe if you want. You should be able to make it easily."::
5326::$$$message_0035_0126_0000$$$::With a skeptical expression, Tohsaka opens the refrigerator.[lr]::
5327::$$$message_0035_0126_0001$$$::She takes out ground beef, lettuce, a tomato, cheese, ketchup, and mustard.[lr]::
5328::$$$message_0035_0126_0002$$$::"Gah. Don't tell me...!"[lr]::
5329::$$$message_0035_0126_0003$$$::Isn't that one of the top 3 "sloppy" foods that Saber dislikes the most, a simple dish that can fill your stomach for the price of just one 500-yen coin!?::
5330::$$$message_0035_0127_0000$$$::[shock vmax=10 time=1500 count=8][font italic=true]Munch, munch.[font italic=false][lr]::
5331::$$$message_0035_0127_0001$$$::I can hear a powerful rhythm from the living room.[lr]::
5332::$$$message_0035_0127_0002$$$::I made it the way Tohsaka taught me. Saber is chewing on it wordlessly, but looking very satisfied.::
5333::$$$message_0035_0128_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
5334::$$$message_0035_0128_0001$$$::It takes a king to know one.[lr]::
5335::$$$message_0035_0128_0002$$$::Saber is eating a hamburger, the king of junk food, like a light snack.[lr]::
5336::$$$message_0035_0128_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Munch, munch, munch, munch.[font italic=false][lr]::
5337::$$$message_0035_0128_0004$$$::Our refrigerator is now nearly empty.[lr]::
5338::$$$message_0035_0128_0005$$$::Tohsaka saw this coming, and took the bicycle to go pick up more groceries.::
5339::$$$message_0035_0129_0000$$$::"...Urgh, so this is what I get for listening to a devil's advice... If only Tohsaka hadn't said that, this would never have happened..."[lr]::
5340::$$$message_0035_0129_0001$$$::I continue making hamburgers as I weep.[lr]::
5341::$$$message_0035_0129_0002$$$::I'm glad Saber's enjoying the food, but hamburgers? Uuugh...::
5342::$$$message_0035_0130_0000$$$::"Shirou, another. Give me the value meal next."[lr]::
5343::$$$message_0035_0130_0001$$$::Very like her to say such simple words with so much force.::
5344::$$$message_0035_0131_0000$$$::"Yes, coming right up!"[lr]::
5345::$$$message_0035_0131_0001$$$::I force a smile while I knead the ground beef.[lr]::
5346::$$$message_0035_0131_0002$$$::An hour passes like that.[lr]::
5347::$$$message_0035_0131_0003$$$::I had to keep up the free smile until lunch ended and Saber was full.::
�